# systemd-sysusers: the grappa system user + group (Arch-native equivalent of
# the .deb preinstall's useradd). Installed to /usr/lib/sysusers.d/grappa.conf.
# The `u` line creates BOTH the user and its primary group `grappa`, with
# home /var/lib/grappa and a nologin shell — a daemon identity, never a login.
#
# Materialized by the systemd-sysusers alpm hook at transaction end, AND
# force-run by grappa.install's post_install (the hook fires AFTER the
# scriptlet, but the first migrate needs the user to already exist).
#
# Type Name    ID  GECOS                  Home            Shell
u     grappa   -   "Grappa IRC bouncer"   /var/lib/grappa /usr/bin/nologin
